{"seq":2,"slug":"sentence-structure","title":"句法结构","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"phrase-structure","title":"短语结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/phrase-structure","wordCount":1818,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"movement-transformations","title":"移位与转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/movement-transformations","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"syntactic-theories","title":"当代句法理论对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/syntactic-theories","wordCount":2187,"readingTime":9},{"seq":4,"slug":"transformational-grammar","title":"转换生成语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/transformational-grammar","wordCount":1954,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"word-order-typology","title":"语序类型学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/word-order-typology","wordCount":1835,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"句法结构-简介\">句法结构 简介</h1><p>本章进入句法学的理论核心，从短语结构的基本规则到生成语法的理论框架，再到当代句法理论的比较，帮助读者掌握分析句子结构的形式化工具。</p>\n<p><strong>短语结构与句法树</strong>讲解短语结构规则的基本概念，介绍如何用句法树图形化表示句子的层次结构和成分关系。</p>\n<p><strong>转换生成语法</strong>介绍乔姆斯基转换生成语法的核心思想，包括深层结构与表层结构的区分、移位规则和普遍语法假说。</p>\n<p><strong>当代句法理论对比</strong>对比最简方案、词汇功能语法、依存语法等当代主要句法理论的基本假设、分析方法和研究目标。</p>\n<p>建议读者先掌握短语结构分析的基本技能，再理解生成语法的理论框架，最后通过理论对比建立开放的学术视野。</p>\n"}